# BUG-PE-062: `vite build` now stages into `dist.tmp` and the atomic
# publish step (`scripts/publish-dist.mjs`) swaps it into `dist`, briefly
# via `dist.prev` -- both are build scratch, never a committed artifact.
dist.tmp
dist.prev
*.local

