# Environments
.env
.envrc
.venv
env/
venv/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# This repo ships its own tracked uv.lock, so (mirroring agent-utilities'
# identical D-75-1/D-CIP-19/D-W3BP-4 pattern) it is its own self-contained uv
# workspace root: `[tool.uv.workspace]` in pyproject.toml pins
# `agent-utilities` as an editable member at this path, symlinked to the real
# sibling checkout already present on the dev/lane machine (no clone, no
# copy) so the repo resolves/tests standalone against its own tracked lock,
# without depending on a larger, untracked, unshipped ecosystem workspace at
# the `agent-packages/` root. Dev/lane-machine-only, never tracked.
.uv-workspace-siblings/

